title: Declare calendar package positional signatures in the SDK grammar census
description: "The installed pm-calendar package exposes cal [view] and calendar [view], including date anchors, but neither command appears in the SDK destination/positional table. The independent static gate fails with two stale_observed_signature findings (231 declared versus 233 observed). Declare both package-owned commands and their existing optional view shape without raising budgets or changing runtime behavior; prove active and inactive package census and arity-drift negative controls."
