actual_result: "Canonical sandboxed coverage passes 10,163 tests across 798 files with exact statements 68097/68097, branches 52238/52238, functions 14040/14040 and lines 64757/64757. Typecheck and all static subgates pass after planning-field and typed-edge repairs, including graph/record assurance and mutation controls. The independently observed installed-package census is 233/233 signatures, zero findings and 20/21 shapes. Linked active/inactive calendar and arity-drift controls pass within the 36-case focused cohort; no runtime calendar behavior or grammar ceiling changed."
